# Sprite art (Craftpix free packs). The license permits use in a game but not
# redistribution of the source assets, so the PNGs stay out of this public repo the
# way the SRD PDF does. The client falls back to circle tokens when they are absent.
# See client/README.md for where to get them and where they go.
# The Craftpix packs may not be redistributed, so the directory is ignored —
# but the hand-drawn art is this project's own and travels with the repo.
# A directory ignore cannot be negated from inside, hence the /* form.
client/assets/sprites/*
